helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152708	644			0	sv	SERIESSUMMA(x;n;m;koefficienter) = koefficient_1*x^n + koefficient_2*x^(n+m) + koefficient_3*x^(n+2m) +...+ koefficient_i*x^(n+(i-1)m)				20130618 17:22:18
