helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156399	221			0	sv	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=BAS(17;10;4)\</item\> returnerar 0017 i decimalsystemet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157871				0	sv	\<bookmark_value\>Binärt system; konvertera till\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
