helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	sv	You can access web forums to ask and answer questions about %PRODUCTNAME.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	sv	Säkerhet				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	sv	In case you are concerned about any security issue with using this software, please refer to the \<link href=\"http://www.openoffice.org/security/index.html\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Security\</link\> page on our website.				20130618 17:22:18
