helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2014				0	sv	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Custom Animation\</item\> deck provides tools to apply animation effects to presentation and graphic objects on your slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20130618 17:22:18
